          "text": "FU I 傅扆 (T. 蘭生 and 彤臣, H. 麗農 and 荔農), June 30, 1614–1684, Nov. 3, official and poet, was a native of Hsin-ch'êng, Shantung. He became a chin-shih in 1655 and in the following year entered official life as police magistrate at Ho-chien, Chihli.",
